 "remarks": "Welcome home to this beautifully updated 2 bedroom, 1.5 bathroom townhouse style condo! Step onto your private, charming front deck and into a sun-filled main level featuring hardwood floors, crown moldings, and a built in electric fireplace- perfect for cozy evenings.  The fully renovated kitchen with quartz countertops, a stylish mosaic tiled backsplash, and stainless steal appliances. A dedicated dining area with sliding glass doors.  Upstairs, you can find two spacious bedrooms with generous closet space, full bathroom, washer and dryer.  Nestled in a peaceful, lushly landscaped complex with lots of green space, yet just minutes to Downtown Stamford, Metro North trains, shopping, and major highways.",
